{% block introduction %}
	<p>
The EGDC Case Study data model is an Application Profile to describe EGDC Case studies.

</p>
{% endblock %}

{% block summary %}
<section id="abstract">
    <h2>Abstract</h2>
    EGDC Case Study data model allows to described EGDC Case Studied together with the Organizations behind it, the attachments, etc.

</section>
{% endblock %}

